OL,3,AUK covid inquiry findings on care
OL,4,Asector set to be published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Covid inquiry will publish its
OL,7,Ffindings on the impact of the pandemic
OL,8,Fon those living and working in the
OL,9,Fadult care sector
OL,11,FIt will include an examination of the
OL,12,Fdecision to free up capacity in
OL,13,Fhospitals by discharging patients into
OL,14,Fadult care and residential homes - what
OL,15,Fthe report is seeking to answer
OL,17,FMore than 43,000 care home residents
OL,18,Fwho died between March 2020 and July
OL,19,F2022 have Covid recorded as a cause on
OL,20,Ftheir death certificates
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
