OL,3,AUK covid inquiry findings on care
OL,4,Asector set to be published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sixth module in the public inquiry
OL,7,Fheard testimonies from ministers, civil
OL,8,Fservants and families - one woman
OL,9,Fdescribed noticing that her mother was
OL,10,Fdying from Covid on a video call before
OL,11,Fstaff had realised
OL,13,FBaroness Hallett, chair of the inquiry,
OL,14,Fwill spell out her findings and
OL,15,Frecommendations after the report is
OL,16,Freleased at 12:00 BST - watch live
OL,17,Fabove
